<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak August unemploymemnt dips to 12.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak August unemploymemnt dips to 12.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in August totalled 316,093, or 12.31 percent of the workforce, down from 12.53 percent in July, the Slovak Ministry of Social Affairs and Labour said on Monday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT RATE     Aug'96   July'96    Aug'95</p>
<p>  total jobless		   316,093  321,661    338,843</p>
<p>  percentage of workforce	12.31    12.53	13.32</p>
<p>-- Peter Laca, Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-536-3687</p>
